# IP-SAKTI Sahayak — Core Conventions

## Identity
- PS: SIH26045, Ministry of Ayush / AIIA
- No OpenAI or Gemini APIs anywhere in the codebase
- LLM: `qwen2.5:7b-instruct-q4_K_M` via Ollama only
- Embeddings: `BAAI/bge-m3` only

## Python style
- Python 3.11, Django 5.x
- 4-space indent, max line 100 chars
- f-strings preferred; no `%`-format
- Type hints on all public functions; `from __future__ import annotations`
- Raise specific exceptions; never bare `except:` or `except Exception: pass`

## Django rules
- Apps: `core`, `chat`, `corpus`, `wizard` — no `apps/` prefix
- `ai/` is a plain Python package (`ai/__init__.py`) — NOT a Django app
- AI sub-modules: `ai.ingest`, `ai.retrieve`, `ai.generate`, `ai.citations`, `ai.safety`, `ai.translate`
- Settings from environment via `pydantic-settings`; never hardcode secrets
- `DEBUG=False` and generic error pages in any non-`runserver` deployment

## Terminology (must be consistent across all files)
- Evidence labels: **Strong evidence** / **Limited evidence** / **Unable to answer from verified sources**
- Internal states: `grounded` / `evidence_only` / `unable_to_answer` / `out_of_scope` / `conflict` / `busy` / `unavailable`
- Regulatory name: **Ayurveda Aahara** (not Aahar, not Aahara-Aahar)
- Model tag: `qwen2.5:7b-instruct-q4_K_M` (never bare `qwen2.5:7b`)

## Frontend design (GOI DBIM 2025 — Header 1 pattern)
- Tricolor strip (5px, saffron/white/green) always at very top
- Accessibility bar below tricolor (skip link, screen reader, A+/A/A- font controls)
- Nav bar uses `var(--color-nav)` (#1a4a8a), saffron bottom border on active/hover items
- Cards: `gov-card` class — saffron top border, 4px border-radius, flat white surface
- Buttons: `gov-btn-primary` (saffron, dark text) / `gov-btn-secondary` (navy outline)
- Section titles: `gov-section-title` class — left saffron 4px bar
- Evidence labels: `ev-label ev-label--strong|limited|unable` — never raw colour strings
- GOI footer: navy, white text, footer links row + disclaimer paragraph + copyright line
- National emblem SVG at `static/images/national-emblem.svg` — replace before submission

## Git
- No AI/Cursor attribution, trailers or co-authored-by lines in commits
- One intent per commit; descriptive imperative subject line
